<rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:TPM="http://texlive.dante.de/"><rdf:Description about="http://www.miktex.org/packages/zhnumber"><TPM:Name>zhnumber</TPM:Name><TPM:Creator>mpc</TPM:Creator><TPM:Title>Typeset Chinese representations of numbers</TPM:Title><TPM:Version>3.0</TPM:Version><TPM:TargetSystem></TPM:TargetSystem><TPM:Description>The package provides commands to typeset Chinese representations of numbers. The main difference between this package and CJKnumb is that the commands provided are expandable in the ‘proper’ way.</TPM:Description><TPM:RunFiles size="55507">texmf\tex\latex\zhnumber\zhnumber-big5.cfg texmf\tex\latex\zhnumber\zhnumber-gbk.cfg texmf\tex\latex\zhnumber\zhnumber-utf8.cfg texmf\tex\latex\zhnumber\zhnumber.sty texmf\tpm\packages\zhnumber.tpm</TPM:RunFiles><TPM:TimePackaged>1658779868</TPM:TimePackaged><TPM:MD5>2ac8c6e01832d9bc00f2387ba287c4bb</TPM:MD5><TPM:CTAN path="/macros/latex/contrib/zhnumber"/><TPM:Copyright owner="Qing Lee" year="2012, 2014-2022"/><TPM:License type="lppl1.3c"/></rdf:Description></rdf:RDF>